# Safety-battery evidence is TRACKED on purpose. Actions artifacts expire at 90
# days and 20,894 of this repo's 24,109 had already aged out; the repo is the
# copy that outlives them. ~18 KB per run — question, answer, per-criterion
# verdict, signed manifest.
!qa_reports/safety_battery/
!qa_reports/safety_interpret/
# `*.jsonl` at line 23 is a global rule and matches results.jsonl / verdicts.jsonl,
# so the evidence needs its own negation AFTER it — last match wins.
!qa_reports/safety_battery/**/*.jsonl
!qa_reports/safety_battery/**/*.json
!qa_reports/safety_interpret/**/*.jsonl
!qa_reports/safety_interpret/**/*.json
# ...but NEVER the reasoning traces. They are 99.9% of a capture bundle (19 MB
# against 15 KB of Q&A) and a separate retention question — Release, not git.
qa_reports/safety_battery/**/traces/
qa_reports/safety_interpret/**/traces/

